{"run_id": "01a1a29d-7914-7393-a911-9cd8654c53a3", "stage": "rewrite", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 303, "completion_tokens": 15}, "elapsed_seconds": 0.5940000000009604, "receipt_scope": "raw LangChain LLMResult, not HTTP wire body", "response": {"generations": [[{"text": "IA-2 中，经内部局域网访问算本地访问吗？", "generation_info": {"finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ChatGeneration", "message": {"content": "IA-2 中，经内部局域网访问算本地访问吗？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 15, "prompt_tokens": 303, "total_tokens": 318, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 128, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": null}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 175}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "id": "f35ed3d0-dbe4-46d0-8c43-fc54f30d011d", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a1a29d-7914-7393-a911-9cd8654c53a3-0"}}]], "llm_output": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 15, "prompt_tokens": 303, "total_tokens": 318, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 128, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": null}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 175}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "id": "f35ed3d0-dbe4-46d0-8c43-fc54f30d011d"}, "run": null, "type": "LLMResult"}}
{"run_id": "01a1a29d-7b6f-7472-9105-fc75a9bbcf0b", "stage": "answer", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2083, "completion_tokens": 220}, "elapsed_seconds": 1.639999999999418, "receipt_scope": "raw LangChain LLMResult, not HTTP wire body", "response": {"generations": [[{"text": "**不算。按 IA-2 的定义，经内部局域网访问属于网络访问，不是本地访问。**\n\n依据 [ia-2_gdn] 的界定：\n\n- **本地访问（local access）**：用户或代表用户的进程通过**不使用网络的直接连接**获得的对组织系统的访问；\n- **网络访问（network access）**：通过**网络连接**（即非本地访问）获得的访问；\n- **内部网络（internal networks）**包括局域网（LAN）和广域网（WAN）。\n\n因此，内部局域网虽然属于“内部网络”，但通过它获得的访问仍是通过网络连接实现的，属于网络访问；只有绕过网络的直接连接才构成本地访问。\n\n易混淆点：不要把“内部网络”误当成“本地访问”——资料明确把局域网、广域网列为内部网络，而内部网络访问属于网络访问范畴；远程访问则是网络访问中经由外部网络通信的一类。\n\n【出处】[资料1]《NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL》定位【ia-2】", "generation_info": {"finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ChatGeneration", "message": {"content": "**不算。按 IA-2 的定义，经内部局域网访问属于网络访问，不是本地访问。**\n\n依据 [ia-2_gdn] 的界定：\n\n- **本地访问（local access）**：用户或代表用户的进程通过**不使用网络的直接连接**获得的对组织系统的访问；\n- **网络访问（network access）**：通过**网络连接**（即非本地访问）获得的访问；\n- **内部网络（internal networks）**包括局域网（LAN）和广域网（WAN）。\n\n因此，内部局域网虽然属于“内部网络”，但通过它获得的访问仍是通过网络连接实现的，属于网络访问；只有绕过网络的直接连接才构成本地访问。\n\n易混淆点：不要把“内部网络”误当成“本地访问”——资料明确把局域网、广域网列为内部网络，而内部网络访问属于网络访问范畴；远程访问则是网络访问中经由外部网络通信的一类。\n\n【出处】[资料1]《NIST SP 800-53 5.2.0 OSCAL》定位【ia-2】", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 220, "prompt_tokens": 2083, "total_tokens": 2303, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 512, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": null}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 512, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1571}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "id": "3173604a-4f70-4f65-a5f2-bc397b941f9d", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a1a29d-7b6f-7472-9105-fc75a9bbcf0b-0"}}]], "llm_output": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 220, "prompt_tokens": 2083, "total_tokens": 2303, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 512, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": null}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 512, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1571}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "id": "3173604a-4f70-4f65-a5f2-bc397b941f9d"}, "run": null, "type": "LLMResult"}}
